OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog 'astounded' by prison
OL,4,Aeducation cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prison watchdog said it has been
OL,7,F"astounded" by a 40% cut to a jail's
OL,8,Feducation budget - saying it would
OL,9,Freduce inmates' chances of
OL,10,Frehabilitation and finding jobs.
OL,12,FThe Independent Monitoring Board (IMB)
OL,13,Fshared its dismay in its annual report
OL,14,Fon HMP Norwich and said the decision
OL,15,Fmeant all vocational courses had been
OL,16,Fdropped with six staff made redundant.
OL,18,FThe IMB also remained concerned that
OL,19,Fassaults on prison staff were not
OL,20,Ftreated as seriously as those on other
OL,21,Femergency workers.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
