OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog 'astounded' by prison
OL,4,Aeducation cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Prison Service spokesperson said the
OL,7,Fsystem was coming "back from the brink
OL,8,Fof collapse" and it was committed to
OL,9,Fhelping prisoners gain skills and
OL,10,Ftraining.
